  - m_Id: 2113923739648
    m_Localized: 'Summon Little Red Riding Hood and her companions.

      They will
      stand guard for a short time, ready to fire on enemies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2113961488384
    m_Localized: "The Town Musicians of Bremen appear. \nTheir four loud howls become
      shockwaves, damaging enemies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2113961488385
    m_Localized: Hansel and Gretel put nearby enemies into a pot, slowly simmering
      their enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23505740147486720
    m_Localized: Summons the LittleMermaid Mermaid , who restores HP for a certain
      duration.
